{"id":"cloze-gen-8","familyId":"cloze-gen-8","skillIds":["cloze.context"],"level":"G2","section":"cloze","reviewMode":"recall","promptZh":"阅读短文，根据上下文在空白处填入适当的词。","resourceId":"cloze-gen-res-8","estimatedSeconds":420,"sourceIds":["tool-generated-practice"],"explanation":{"summaryZh":"科技馆的一次参观","ruleZh":"完形：先通读抓主旨，再逐空看搭配与上下文。","evidence":[{"resourceId":"cloze-gen-res-8","paragraphId":"p1","quote":"The science museum opened a new hall last month, a"}],"distractors":[]},"kind":"gaps","inputMode":"text","sharedOptions":[],"uniqueOptions":false,"segments":[{"type":"text","text":"The science museum opened a new hall last month, and our teacher took us there "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g1"},{"type":"text","text":"Friday. Unlike the old halls, the new one is built around a single idea: visitors should "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g2"},{"type":"text","text":"the exhibits, not just "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g3"},{"type":"text","text":"at them."},{"type":"text","text":"In the first area, we pushed levers and turned wheels to see "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g4"},{"type":"text","text":"simple machines change the "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g5"},{"type":"text","text":"of force. In the second, a computer followed our movements and showed how the human body "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g6"},{"type":"text","text":"balance while walking."},{"type":"text","text":"The most popular exhibit was a model bridge. Visitors "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g7"},{"type":"text","text":"invited to build it again and again, and "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g8"},{"type":"text","text":"time the screen shows "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g9"},{"type":"text","text":"the bridge would fall. Many students tried five "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g10"},{"type":"text","text":"six times before they found the strongest design."},{"type":"text","text":"On the bus back to school, we argued happily about "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g11"},{"type":"text","text":"bridge had stood longest. Our teacher said that this was exactly "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g12"},{"type":"text","text":"the museum wanted: not to teach us facts, but to make us "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g13"},{"type":"text","text":"questions. Science, she said, begins when you wonder "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g14"},{"type":"text","text":"something happens, not when you copy the answer "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g15"},{"type":"text","text":"a book."}],"gaps":[{"id":"g1","label":"第1空","clue":"无提示词：介词","options":[],"accepted":["on"],"explanationZh":"on Friday"},{"id":"g2","label":"第2空","clue":"填动词原形（should 后）","options":[],"accepted":["touch","operate"],"explanationZh":"should + 原形"},{"id":"g3","label":"第3空","clue":"填动词原形","options":[],"accepted":["look","stare"],"explanationZh":"look at"},{"id":"g4","label":"第4空","clue":"无提示词：连接词","options":[],"accepted":["how"],"explanationZh":"see how"},{"id":"g5","label":"第5空","clue":"填名词","options":[],"accepted":["direction"],"explanationZh":"力的方向"},{"id":"g6","label":"第6空","clue":"填动词第三人称单数","options":[],"accepted":["keeps"],"explanationZh":"keeps balance"},{"id":"g7","label":"第7空","clue":"填动词 be 复数现在式","options":[],"accepted":["are"],"explanationZh":"被动"},{"id":"g8","label":"第8空","clue":"填形容词/代词","options":[],"accepted":["each","every"],"explanationZh":"each time"},{"id":"g9","label":"第9空","clue":"填连接副词","options":[],"accepted":["why","how"],"explanationZh":"shows why"},{"id":"g10","label":"第10空","clue":"无提示词：连词","options":[],"accepted":["or"],"explanationZh":"five or six"},{"id":"g11","label":"第11空","clue":"无提示词：定语从句","options":[],"accepted":["whose"],"explanationZh":"whose bridge"},{"id":"g12","label":"第12空","clue":"无提示词：代词","options":[],"accepted":["what"],"explanationZh":"exactly what"},{"id":"g13","label":"第13空","clue":"填动词原形","options":[],"accepted":["ask"],"explanationZh":"make us ask"},{"id":"g14","label":"第14空","clue":"填连接副词","options":[],"accepted":["why","how"],"explanationZh":"wonder why"},{"id":"g15","label":"第15空","clue":"无提示词：介词","options":[],"accepted":["from"],"explanationZh":"copy from"}],"policy":{"caseSensitive":false,"allowTerminalPunctuation":true}}
